# Vientiane Markets — Cloudflare Pages edge redirects
# Default language is "lo" (Lao) and it is served at the site ROOT "/"
# (src/pages/index.astro renders the Lao page; src/i18n/ui.ts defaultLang = 'lo').
# Therefore a "/  /lo/  302" rule would 404 (there is no /lo/ index page,
# only /lo/privacy, /lo/terms, /lo/cookie-settings). Do NOT add that rule.
#
# Safety redirect: some external links may point at "/lo" (no trailing slash);
# send them to the real Lao home at "/".
/lo    /    302
